 p is a ONE-FOR-ONE trade with a limit of three books per person. RULES *No
  textbooks\, reference materials\, manuals or magazines*Max three books pe
 r person*Books in good condition accepted (no yellowed pages\, speckling\,
  stains or major tears) We reserve the right to reject books that are not 
 clean or readable*No mass dumping of books
